     ui/fail/param_shadowing.rs + unit tests (tuple-pattern shadow caught too).
  ✔ Require a single top-level loop shape (2 loops / trailing code) → NEW
     check_single_top_level_loop; ui/fail/multiple_top_level_loops.rs + unit tests.
     (loop-in-branch / no-loop already rejected by the has_top_level_loop gate.)
  ✔ CDC: domain A into a domain-B port outside a synchronizer → ui/fail/cdc_crossing.rs
     (trybuild UI case over the pre-existing check_cdc; complements cdc.rs doctests).
  ✔ CDC: a module CONSTRUCTING a clock → ui/fail/clock_construction.rs (over the
     pre-existing check_no_clock_construction).
  ✔ Unsupported idiom (panic!/Option/`?`) rejected    → ui/fail/unsupported_idiom_panic.rs
  ✔ Pass boundary case (pre-loop reg + single loop + non-colliding local) → ui/pass/single_loop_local_ok.rs
